{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>烏克蘭的能源設施仍然受襲，沙特首都利雅得的機場亦遇襲，並造成人命傷亡，原油期貨價格上升。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報93.74美元一桶，升1.89美元，升幅百分之2。倫敦期油收市報106.65美元一桶，升1.93美元，升幅百分之1.8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T22:58:37.836880+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T22:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T23:17:40.758776+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T22:57:38.037938+00:00","content_hash":"1aec0072b1d1ca23d0abe5ebd40dcacf7dc31c2da787f147e7a0a224fefc3f4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}